  "texts": [
    "In this section you can find all properties related to making admin connections from the operator to the server. These settings are not used by the server.",
    "The HTTP port exposed on the Kubernetes Service. When set, the Service will use this port while the pod still listens on httpPort.",
    "The HTTPS port exposed on the Kubernetes Service. When set, the Service will use this port while the pod still listens on httpsPort.",
    "The name of the Kubernetes Service. When not set, the name defaults to the Keycloak CR name with a \"-service\" suffix.",
    "Annotations to be appended to the Service object",
    "Labels to be appended to the Service object",
    "In this section you can configure general shared OpenTelemetry settings for Keycloak.",
    "OpenTelemetry resource attributes present in the exported trace to characterize the telemetry producer.",
    "DEPRECATED - use the 'telemetry.resourceAttributes' instead. OpenTelemetry resource attributes present in the exported trace to characterize the telemetry producer.",
